<title>POLAND: Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex, Stalexport and Universal fell and Elektrim rose in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>BRE was flat and the remaining five stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 1.1 million zlotys, up from 0.4 million on Friday.</p>
<p>NFI units fell in a 21.1 million zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
